@AcademicEvents.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@token = cole_o_token_aqui

### Cadastrar usuário
POST {{AcademicEvents.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "Senha123!"
}

### Login
POST {{AcademicEvents.API_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "maria@teste.com",
  "senha": "Senha123!"
}

### Listar eventos
GET {{AcademicEvents.API_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### Criar evento
POST {{AcademicEvents.API_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "titulo": "Workshop de C# em Manaus",
  "descricao": "Workshop prático sobre ASP.NET Core",
  "dataInicio": "2026-06-10T09:00:00",
  "dataFim": "2026-06-10T18:00:00",
  "local": "Bloco A - Sala 201"
}
